        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "坪突風吹無害，山窠風射有妨；乎洋不怕風吹，山谷切宜。",
        "confidence": "medium",
        "uncertainty": [
